Depends: python3, python3-pyqt5, python3-xdg, xdg-utils, hicolor-icon-theme, wmctrl, x11-utils, xdotool, at-spi2-core, orca, speech-dispatcher-espeak-ng
Recommends: pcmanfm-qt, qterminal, network-manager-gnome, pavucontrol-qt, papirus-icon-theme, qtwayland5, lxqt-session, openbox, bluez, brightnessctl, lxqt-wayland-session, labwc
Suggests: slick-greeter, lightdm
Description: Edukasaun Desktop 0.9.12 - Action Center and Sessions Patch
 Edukasaun Desktop, Eduka-Menu, Eduka-Menu Settings, and Eduka-Panel.
 Adds an Eduka-Panel Action Center (calendar, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, airplane
 mode, sound, brightness, battery), rounded context menus everywhere, a
 colorful category and application palette that changes on every opening,
 adjustable menu-button pictures, and Eduka-Desktop (X11) and Eduka-Desktop
 (Wayland) login sessions for LightDM, slick-greeter and other greeters.
